        "node_id": "n_2_cd9a23",
        "thought_text": "Use dynamic programming to count the valid configurations. Define dp[i][j] as the number of ways to assign values to the first i houses such that the conditions are met up to house j. Transition between states by considering the placement of values on the (i+1)-th house and ensuring it does not violate the given constraints.",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "root",
