        "thought_text": "Consider permutations of house indices and check if they satisfy the given conditions. For each permutation, verify that starting from houses 1 to k leads to house 1 and starting from houses k+1 to n does not. Count all such valid permutations, taking care to apply the modulo operation at each step to prevent overflow.",
